{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuwen-e-6af306d7507e4464ca8b","title":"曹冲穿衣救库吏，前后微辨救罪人数十","accounts":[{"id":"wuwen-a-6af306d7507e4464ca8b","label":"正文","text":"曹冲穿衣救库吏，前后微辨救罪人数十","evidence":["wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongyuan-p0188","role":"救免者","evidence":["wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"赦免者","evidence":["wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb","order":3852}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"dongyuan-p0188","name":"曹冲","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuwen-q-e47d033b9b269e5ac1cb","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ad0248ea4e8e77f5a95b","layer":"original","quote":"时军国多事，用刑严重。太祖马鞍在库，而为鼠所啮；库吏惧必死，议欲面缚首罪，犹惧不免〖5〗。冲谓曰：“待三日中，然后自归〖6〗。”冲于是以刀穿单衣〖7〗，如鼠啮者；谬为失意〖8〗，貌有愁色。太祖问之，冲对曰：“世俗以为鼠啮衣者，其主不吉。今单衣见啮，是以忧戚。”太祖曰：“此妄言耳！无所苦也。”俄而库吏以啮鞍闻，太祖笑曰：“儿衣在侧〖9〗，尚啮；况鞍悬柱乎？”一无所问。冲仁爱识达，皆此类也。凡应罪戮，而为冲微所辨理〖10〗，赖以济宥者，前后数十。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":226,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
